---
import {timeline} from "./data/timeline";
import TimelineCard from "./components/TimelineCard.astro";
import "./styles/timeline.css";
---
<section id="timeline" class="timeline" aria-labelledby="journey-title"><div class="timeline__container"><header class="journey-header"><div><span class="journey-header__eyebrow">JOURNEY / SYSTEM EVOLUTION</span><h2 id="journey-title">One direction. Several stages.</h2></div><p>The engineering path did not begin with AI or cybersecurity. GURUVERSE makes the progression visible instead of hiding the transitions between disciplines.</p></header><div class="timeline__path">{timeline.map(event=><TimelineCard event={event}/>)}</div></div></section>